{
  "name": "discord-voice",
  "kind": "module",
  "module": "zinc:discord-voice",
  "entry": "index.ts",
  "description": "Discord voice calls: the voice gateway v8, UDP with IP discovery, RTP in the aead_aes256_gcm_rtpsize (the engine's mbedTLS) and aead_xchacha20_poly1305_rtpsize (Monocypher) modes, Opus 48 kHz stereo 20 ms (the libopus of plugins/webrtc), a jitter buffer per speaker and the mix, capture and playback (miniaudio), mute, deafen and push-to-talk, video (H.264 through VideoToolbox: the cameras of the call decoded at the size they are shown, ours encoded and sent), and DAVE, the end-to-end encryption of calls (libdave and mlspp on a vendored BoringSSL)",
  "requires": [
    "net",
    "threads"
  ],
